        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset Classic Valiant Half-Round Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Valiant Knob lends a classic look blending well with colonial design style homes or offices. This Classic Colonial Half-Round Knob is a long time favorite. With an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches for 1-3/8 inch to 1-3/4 inch doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Kwikset Valiant Door Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Solid steel strike.</li>\r\n<li>Fits most pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>5 pin system.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty.</b></li>\r\n<li><b>5 Year Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Specifications</b> of the Valiant Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable for 1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\" Thick Doors</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b> for the Kwikset (T) Valiant Knob and Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> An inactive knob for use as a pull or to match trim. This non-operational knob is for one side of the door. Complete Set - 1 knob and 1 rose.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Turnbutton on interior knob engages privacy lock on both knobs; emergency release hole is on exterior knob. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry:</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. An ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 3 security lock that is operated by a key from the exterior and a turnbutton on the knob from the interior. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 keys, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<b>**This Item is Discontinued. See <a href=\"/collections/kwikset-knobs\">Kwikset Door Knobs</a><b> for available options.\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n</p>",
